---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Base title="Contribute" description="Ways to help build and support Stratum.">
  <Nav />

  <main class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-20">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ochre-deep">Contribute</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl font-bold text-ink">Help build Stratum</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      Stratum is open source and free to run. There are a few ways to help, with or without writing code.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-px border border-parchment-line bg-parchment-line sm:grid-cols-2">

      <!-- Code -->
      <div class="border-t-4 border-t-moss bg-parchment-panel p-7">
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink">Code</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 mb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          Read the contributing guide before opening a pull request. It covers the build setup, the patch
          workflow, and what to include for performance work.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/StratumServer/Stratum/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="bg-bedrock px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-parchment-light transition-colors hover:bg-ink"
          >
            Contributing guide
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/StratumServer/Stratum"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="border border-parchment-line px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:border-ink-faint"
          >
            GitHub
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bug reports -->
      <div class="border-t-4 border-t-ochre bg-parchment-panel p-7">
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink">Bug reports</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 mb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          Use the issue templates on GitHub. Before filing, check whether the problem also happens on a stock
          Vintage Story server. If it does, report it upstream.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/StratumServer/Stratum/issues/new/choose"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-block border border-parchment-line px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:border-ink-faint"
        >
          Open an issue
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Financial -->
      <div class="border-t-4 border-t-ore bg-parchment-panel p-7">
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink">Fund the work</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 mb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          Stratum is built and maintained in spare time. Our Open Collective is the place to chip in. It is
          transparent, so you can see exactly what comes in and where it goes.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://opencollective.com/stratum"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-block bg-bedrock px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-parchment-light transition-colors hover:bg-ink"
        >
          Support on Open Collective
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Community -->
      <div class="border-t-4 border-t-rock bg-parchment-panel p-7">
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink">Community</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 mb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          Most day-to-day discussion happens on Discord. Helping other server owners get set up, sharing
          feedback, and reporting what you see on your own server are all genuinely useful.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://discord.gg/pd24fawhsD"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-block border border-parchment-line px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:border-ink-faint"
        >
          Join Discord
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Security note -->
    <div class="mt-6 border-l-2 border-ore bg-parchment-panel p-6">
      <h2 class="mb-2 font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink">Security issues</h2>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
        Security vulnerabilities do not go in the issue tracker. See the
        <a href="https://github.com/StratumServer/Stratum/blob/main/SECURITY.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-ore-deep underline decoration-parchment-line underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-ore">security policy</a>
        for how to report them.
      </p>
    </div>

  </main>

  <Footer />
</Base>
